Font
  name: Verdana-11px-italic
  texture: Verdana-11px-italic
  height: 15
  glyph-size: 22 15
  space-width: 3

// Disabled for the Backlands login module.
//
// The text atlas is a fixed 2048x2048 (Atlas::init, no BIG_FONTS) and it was
// already full: registering one single extra font aborted the client with
// "[Atlas] Out of space for new fonts". This font is referenced nowhere in
// modules/, data/ or init.lua, so its 512px block was freed to make room for
// silkscreen-16 (the login fields' typeface). Rename back to .otfont to
// restore it - but then drop silkscreen-16, or rebuild with -DBIG_FONTS.
